{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなしゃん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/30/8765783/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんな感想ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/30/8765783/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここまで短いのは人生始めてなもので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここ毎日鏡を見ると誰？ってなる自分がおる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあね、賛否両論ありますが、能條はとうぶんこいつで生きていきます。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話は変わって、学校の友達とこの間ここに行って来ました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/30/8765783/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うりゃぁーーー美味しそうだろおおぉー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/30/8765783/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ食べた瞬間、女の子に生まれてよかったって思った。にっこり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ね、あぁ女の子に生まれてよかったって思う事すごく多くてね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガールズトークしてても、甘いもの食べても、洋服選んでても、メイクしてても！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しみじみ女子でいる幸せを感じる訳ですよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さだこの映画観たい。てへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいここで突然の質問返し！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*Ｑ*ところでプリンちゃんて何？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.えーと、茶色に染めたんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪の毛が伸びてきて上の部分が黒髪が目立つこと！！そういうこと！！と！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*Ｑ*握手会の時だけ娘になってくれる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.うん！！パパーーーー！！！お菓子買ってーー笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*Ｑ*もしも、握手会とライブが別々に行われる事になって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どちらか一方しか行けないとなったら、あみちゃんならどっちを選ぶ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.両方って言いたいとこだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブかな？？メンバーみんなに迷惑かかっちゃうからね(´･_･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*Ｑ*男で好きな髪型は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.ほんのり茶髪で、ワックスでふんわりさせてる感じかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"基本的に清潔感があれば良し！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*Ｑ*あみちゃんはなんで乃木坂に入ろうと思ったの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.自分の実力を試してみたかったから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*Ｑ*５月１９日は何の日だったか分かりますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.始めて握手しにきてくれたよね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*Ｑ*今年の夏に１番したい事は何ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.山に登ってみたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*Ｑ*☆あみあみ☆から☆あみちゃ☆に呼び方変えちゃったけどOKかなぁ!?(汗)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.あみちゃ！かわいい！！好きなように呼んで？(´･_･`)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/30/8765783/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*Ｑ*香川県に来たことある?またイメージは?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.ないです！！香川県といえば、うどん！！香川のうどん食べてみたいなぁー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここまで！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また明日ーね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいばいあみあみ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/30/8765783/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゅ"}],"source":"archive"}